<title>USA: CBOE to list Omnipoint options Nov 11.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list Omnipoint options Nov 11.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said Monday it will begin trading options on shares of Omnipoint Corp on November 11.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options will have opening strike prices of 25, 30 and 35, with initial expirations in December, January, February and May.</p>
<p>The options will trade in the Hewlett-Packard Co crowd, the CBOE said.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
